    "title": "Bryan man makes history at diesel drag race in Indianapolis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andre Gonzales ,\n1 days ago BRYAN, Texas (KBTX) - A Bryan man has won first place in the Firepunk 72Fast Diesel Shootout in Indianapolis. Matthew Parker, whose race shop is based in Bryan, took home the $70,000 grand prize, the largest payout in diesel drag racing history. Read full article\n1",
